Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:45:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Clinical notes and intake forms on one templates engine

- Templates engine: one format for notes and intake forms (text, choices,
  yes/no with details, vitals, repeatable rows); records keep a copy of the
  template they were filled in on
- Templates: General consultation (SOAP), Treatment record (aesthetics/IV),
  Health questionnaire, Massage and spa health check, Skin and beauty
  consultation, Before your treatment (aesthetics/IV)
- Migration 0010: clinical_notes (drafts private, sign to lock, never
  edited or deleted once signed), addenda with reasons, intake_submissions
  (consent + typed name, unchangeable), intake links (hashed, single use,
  7 days); practitioners/admins read clinical content, front desk sees
  status only; module switches enforced; activity log without content
- Pages: member clinical record (timeline, allergy alert), note editor
  (autosave drafts, required fields on signing, addenda, print), intake on
  a practice device (locked; staff code to leave), intake by link (no
  login, practice colours); profile and dashboard shortcuts
- Demo seed clears clinical records before reseeding
- Tests: 40 new database checks (205 in total)

